WEBVTT

01:34.600 --> 01:37.670
[Bloom Life]

01:38.500 --> 01:42.710
[2014]

01:43.680 --> 01:44.590
Her efforts

01:44.880 --> 01:46.950
made those who stuck to the old ways

01:46.970 --> 01:48.300
feel even more ashamed.

01:48.420 --> 01:51.350
Her failure speaks louder
than the stagnant comfort

01:51.590 --> 01:53.390
of those who never move forward.

01:53.870 --> 01:54.710
Well written.

01:56.009 --> 01:56.340
Go.

01:56.789 --> 01:57.900
Go and exchange it for another book.

01:57.900 --> 01:58.509
Okay.

02:00.570 --> 02:01.100
Minawar.

02:01.110 --> 02:01.710
I wrote it.

02:07.000 --> 02:07.870
In my memory,

02:08.860 --> 02:10.800
going to my middle school
Chinese teacher

02:10.800 --> 02:12.330
Ms. Li's house for tutoring

02:13.360 --> 02:15.610
was like a ray of light breaking

02:15.930 --> 02:17.860
into our otherwise routine lives.

02:18.300 --> 02:20.890
Her bookcase became my secret garden.

02:21.900 --> 02:22.900
There,

02:23.710 --> 02:26.150
we read de Beauvoir's "The Second Sex,"

02:27.130 --> 02:29.130
encountered Jane Eyre's defiance,

02:30.280 --> 02:32.030
and witnessed Sanmao's drifting life.

02:32.030 --> 02:32.930
Ms. Li,

02:33.190 --> 02:34.320
I don't understand.

02:34.630 --> 02:36.360
Ms. Wang had already taken her child

02:36.360 --> 02:38.740
and left her first abusive husband.

02:39.150 --> 02:41.150
Why did she enter marriage again

02:41.420 --> 02:42.600
to suffer once more?

02:43.520 --> 02:44.130
When women

02:44.130 --> 02:46.150
become the deepest bearers of suffering,

02:46.150 --> 02:47.750
the first step of their awakening is

02:47.750 --> 02:50.079
to admit the real existence of suffering.

02:51.240 --> 02:52.460
Xiao Hong used her pen

02:52.610 --> 02:54.340
to etch an indelible tombstone

02:54.620 --> 02:55.570
for those

02:55.600 --> 02:57.060
silent Ms. Wangs.

02:58.079 --> 02:58.570
Laili.

02:59.430 --> 03:00.120
Ms. Li.

03:00.150 --> 03:00.890
Your notes.

03:02.580 --> 03:03.710
I didn't bring them.

03:04.020 --> 03:04.540
You didn't write any.

03:04.540 --> 03:06.070
I really didn't bring them.

03:06.190 --> 03:07.990
I wrote them at Arzugul's house.

03:08.410 --> 03:09.900
Yesterday.

03:09.920 --> 03:11.650
Yes. She wrote them at my house.

03:13.070 --> 03:15.120
Okay. Then tell me,

03:15.410 --> 03:17.670
which character in the novel do you like?

03:20.860 --> 03:21.920
The painter Lily.

03:24.320 --> 03:26.440
Ms. Li, I actually also think sometimes

03:26.440 --> 03:28.970
Why haven't I thought
about creating myself?

03:29.620 --> 03:31.110
Mom, I'm back.

03:36.360 --> 03:37.180
Xia Zi?

03:37.870 --> 03:38.860
Fang Nan?

03:54.620 --> 03:58.240
[Episode 7: The A and B Roles of Life]

04:04.420 --> 04:06.320
♪ That familiar red apple ♪

04:06.340 --> 04:13.550
♪ Just like my lover's red face ♪

04:13.570 --> 04:17.370
♪ The tender whisper of the lover ♪

04:17.390 --> 04:20.700
♪ is as sweet as sugar ♪

04:20.720 --> 04:24.550
♪ The tender whisper of the lover ♪

04:24.580 --> 04:27.990
♪ is as sweet as sugar ♪

04:28.020 --> 04:31.480
♪ A lover like pomegranate ♪

04:31.500 --> 04:38.500
♪ A lover like a balsam flower ♪

04:39.690 --> 04:40.570
It's so pretty.

04:40.980 --> 04:42.540
Minawar has great taste.

04:43.240 --> 04:44.360
You just finished
your postpartum confinement.

04:44.360 --> 04:45.760
Are you adapting to work?

04:46.080 --> 04:46.790
Not bad.

04:47.800 --> 04:48.930
I really envy you.

04:49.430 --> 04:51.000
We are exhausted every day.

04:51.370 --> 04:52.100
I didn't expect

04:52.100 --> 04:53.960
"Alip and Sänäm" to be so popular.

04:55.240 --> 04:56.800
It was tiring enough after the tour.

04:56.800 --> 04:58.100
The extra performances are over,

04:58.100 --> 05:00.920
and now they're throwing
in some kind of wrap-up show.

05:00.920 --> 05:03.130
Thankfully, the last few shows
are in Kashgar.

05:03.130 --> 05:05.260
I really don't want to travel anymore.

05:05.610 --> 05:06.240
Dear,

05:06.580 --> 05:07.840
help me zip up my dress.

05:13.430 --> 05:14.360
You were the one

05:14.850 --> 05:17.650
who told Sadiq and my mother-in-law,
weren't you?

05:18.090 --> 05:19.890
What are you even talking about?

05:20.940 --> 05:22.350
Take good care of the child.

05:22.350 --> 05:23.550
Don't think too much.

05:31.110 --> 05:33.440
You're not the only one
who can play Sänäm.

05:34.530 --> 05:35.990
How am I any worse than you?

05:37.270 --> 05:39.330
Why am I always just your understudy?

05:53.510 --> 05:55.440
Come back quickly to feed the baby.

05:55.520 --> 05:57.190
The baby threw up again.

05:57.690 --> 05:58.750
The baby won't sleep

05:58.750 --> 05:59.950
and just keeps crying

06:21.650 --> 06:23.970
Hello, Auntie. Hello, Laili.

06:23.990 --> 06:24.620
Hello.

06:28.060 --> 06:28.950
Come on in.

06:32.860 --> 06:34.010
Your dad, really.

06:34.400 --> 06:36.230
I asked him to buy a honeydew melon.

06:36.230 --> 06:38.060
Why hasn't he come back for so long?

06:38.060 --> 06:38.870
I'll go take a look.

06:38.870 --> 06:39.990
I'll go.

06:44.500 --> 06:45.060
Dad.

06:47.570 --> 06:48.180
Dad.

06:51.250 --> 06:51.720
Dad!

06:52.920 --> 06:54.860
What's wrong with you?

06:55.480 --> 06:56.270
Somebody!

06:56.510 --> 06:57.630
Help!

06:58.130 --> 06:58.740
Dad.

07:13.540 --> 07:14.080
Mom.

07:15.200 --> 07:16.730
How is your dad doing today?

07:17.210 --> 07:18.270
The doctor said

07:18.290 --> 07:19.960
my dad is out of danger.

07:21.390 --> 07:22.620
The rest is just

07:22.620 --> 07:24.280
a matter of time for recovery.

07:24.490 --> 07:25.950
He will slowly get better.

07:27.010 --> 07:28.810
Then you should rest early, too.

07:28.980 --> 07:30.510
You've stayed up for 3 days.

07:30.660 --> 07:32.120
Your body won't handle it.

07:32.180 --> 07:33.460
I'm fine, Mom.

07:33.830 --> 07:34.500
Go and rest.

07:34.640 --> 07:36.050
Okay, you rest first.

07:36.080 --> 07:36.540
Okay.

07:51.630 --> 07:52.370
Laili.

07:52.400 --> 07:53.000
What is it?

07:55.260 --> 07:55.940
Have a bite

07:56.950 --> 07:57.880
while it's warm.

07:57.920 --> 07:59.310
I'm fine. I'm not hungry.

07:59.310 --> 08:00.450
Your health is the most important.

08:00.450 --> 08:01.160
You should eat something.

08:01.160 --> 08:02.420
I'm really not hungry.

08:04.810 --> 08:06.740
What are your plans for the future?

08:08.270 --> 08:10.530
Master can't make earthenware anymore.

08:10.680 --> 08:11.360
The shop is going to close.

08:11.360 --> 08:12.430
It won't close.

08:13.150 --> 08:14.680
I'll figure something out.

08:15.070 --> 08:17.330
How are you going
to keep the shop afloat?

08:17.450 --> 08:18.800
I admit you're better than me.

08:18.800 --> 08:19.560
And you look down on me.

08:19.560 --> 08:21.290
I have never looked down on you.

08:21.300 --> 08:22.560
Really, Mulading.

08:22.670 --> 08:26.330
I've envied you since I was little
because you can make earthenware.

08:26.330 --> 08:28.530
It's true that I just started learning.

08:29.180 --> 08:29.890
So,

08:30.560 --> 08:32.090
I want to ask you for a favor.

08:33.820 --> 08:35.679
Teach me how to make earthenware.

08:37.270 --> 08:38.549
Why should I help you?

08:39.350 --> 08:40.450
Who will help me?

08:42.270 --> 08:43.049
Have you ever asked me

08:43.049 --> 08:44.010
what I want?

08:45.470 --> 08:47.510
But that was all my dad's idea.

08:47.850 --> 08:49.650
That guy from the instrument shop

08:49.650 --> 08:51.310
does have his carving skills.

08:52.130 --> 08:54.790
But his hands are meant
for making instruments.

08:55.960 --> 08:57.370
Are you really willing to let
those instrument-making hands

08:57.370 --> 08:59.120
soak in mud all day?

08:59.610 --> 09:00.550
If you don't want the shop to close,

09:00.550 --> 09:02.150
What you need right now is me.

09:04.610 --> 09:05.940
Master has fallen ill.

09:07.740 --> 09:09.670
He can no longer make earthenware.

09:12.390 --> 09:13.790
You need to face reality.

10:10.700 --> 10:11.500
Aletong.

10:12.010 --> 10:14.500
The noodles you made today
are so delicious.

10:14.500 --> 10:15.960
I've already eaten 2 plates.

10:15.960 --> 10:17.960
Did Nur make the noodles, or did you?

10:18.370 --> 10:19.890
Of course, Nur made them.

10:20.100 --> 10:22.700
Nur makes the noodles,
and you eat them, right?

10:26.860 --> 10:27.880
Look, look.

10:28.650 --> 10:31.370
Today, Dali police received
a report from the public.

10:31.370 --> 10:33.960
A homestay owner defrauded
local residents of their homes.

10:33.960 --> 10:35.790
Under the pretext of opening a homestay,

10:35.790 --> 10:38.650
he illegally misappropriated
nearly half a million yuan.

10:38.650 --> 10:39.430
500,000?

10:39.820 --> 10:40.480
He ran away.

10:41.600 --> 10:43.220
When did Zhou leave?

10:44.080 --> 10:45.650
Did anything happen to him?

10:47.580 --> 10:48.960
I don't think Zhou

10:48.960 --> 10:50.620
would do something like this.

10:51.050 --> 10:51.890
I believe him.

10:52.510 --> 10:54.440
You can't judge a book by its cover.

10:54.660 --> 10:55.480
He won't run away.

10:55.480 --> 10:57.410
He absolutely would
do something like this.

10:57.410 --> 10:59.290
It's just the doing of a few individuals.

10:59.290 --> 11:01.600
But it's been so long,

11:01.910 --> 11:04.710
and he hasn't let
the renovation team resume work.

11:05.200 --> 11:06.200
Keep your voice down.

11:06.200 --> 11:07.720
Don't make Arzugul worry.

11:10.320 --> 11:11.890
From my interactions with him,

11:11.890 --> 11:14.120
I think he has a great character.

11:14.700 --> 11:16.150
So I believe him.

11:55.910 --> 11:58.570
This instrument seems
a bit smaller than usual.

12:00.220 --> 12:03.530
Because it's for a female customer,

12:04.050 --> 12:05.380
it's made a bit smaller.

12:09.580 --> 12:10.510
How is Uncle Batur?

12:10.510 --> 12:11.550
He's doing well.

12:13.100 --> 12:14.030
Have you decided

12:15.170 --> 12:16.630
what pattern to carve?

12:18.320 --> 12:20.720
Not yet. So I made this first.

12:24.910 --> 12:26.960
How about a pomegranate pattern?

12:26.960 --> 12:28.720
When we first met,

12:28.720 --> 12:30.360
you gave me a pomegranate.

12:30.770 --> 12:32.240
Pomegranate flowers are nice.

12:32.240 --> 12:32.870
Okay.

12:33.870 --> 12:35.670
Pomegranate flowers are great.

12:41.080 --> 12:41.820
Wait for me a sec.

12:41.820 --> 12:42.220
Okay.

13:23.410 --> 13:24.210
What's wrong?

13:24.600 --> 13:25.320
Nothing.

13:25.320 --> 13:26.360
I have things to do at home.

13:26.360 --> 13:27.820
I'm heading back now. Bye.

15:02.590 --> 15:06.820
♪ We swore we'd never part ♪

15:09.380 --> 15:13.910
♪ Sharing good times, our love was true ♪

15:16.130 --> 15:22.740
♪ A long-held wish seemed to come true ♪

15:23.140 --> 15:28.230
♪ But fate was far too cruel ♪

15:27.240 --> 15:28.570
Dad.

15:30.030 --> 15:35.980
♪ A long-held wish seemed to come true ♪

15:36.790 --> 15:42.230
♪ But fate was far too cruel ♪

15:38.820 --> 15:41.630
Laili didn't answer my call.

15:43.630 --> 15:50.230
♪ Bound together like Laili and Majnun ♪

15:44.720 --> 15:47.440
She won't see me, either.

15:50.600 --> 15:51.860
What should I do?

15:50.750 --> 15:57.490
♪ Lingering like lovers,
wasting time away ♪

15:57.510 --> 16:03.740
♪ Bound together like Laili and Majnun ♪

16:04.280 --> 16:10.240
♪ Lingering like lovers,
wasting time away ♪

16:11.130 --> 16:17.240
♪ We wiped away each other's tears ♪

16:17.940 --> 16:22.720
♪ But fate was far too cruel ♪

16:36.870 --> 16:38.730
If this marriage must happen,

16:39.940 --> 16:42.850
it'll be hard for both Laili and me.

16:44.180 --> 16:46.640
I really don't know what to do.

16:52.080 --> 16:56.740
♪ You once said you'd leave one day ♪

16:59.100 --> 17:03.530
♪ But I said that day would never come ♪

17:05.810 --> 17:12.220
♪ You said if a lover wanders alone ♪

17:12.710 --> 17:17.150
♪ I wouldn't have suffered this much ♪

17:19.760 --> 17:25.740
♪ You said if a lover wanders alone ♪

17:26.730 --> 17:30.830
♪ I wouldn't have suffered this much ♪

17:33.590 --> 17:39.870
♪ Bound together like Laili and Majnun ♪

17:40.420 --> 17:46.630
♪ Lingering like lovers,
wasting time away ♪

17:47.220 --> 17:53.440
♪ Bound together like Laili and Majnun ♪

17:54.180 --> 18:00.440
♪ Lingering like lovers,
wasting time away ♪

18:00.750 --> 18:07.050
♪ We wiped away each other's tears ♪

18:07.840 --> 18:12.340
♪ But fate is so cruel ♪

18:16.720 --> 18:18.520
It's rare for us to get together.

18:18.810 --> 18:21.290
Too bad Minawar isn't here.

18:22.090 --> 18:23.610
I went away for a while

18:23.700 --> 18:24.740
and came back to find out

18:24.740 --> 18:26.880
Minawar has become a mother.

18:26.900 --> 18:28.620
Yeah, time flies.

18:28.850 --> 18:30.580
She really wanted to come, too.

18:30.740 --> 18:32.010
Does she still dance?

18:32.350 --> 18:33.140
She's

18:33.750 --> 18:34.770
a bit busy now.

18:34.800 --> 18:35.880
Probably just...

18:42.270 --> 18:43.900
My yogurt zongzi is ready.

18:44.140 --> 18:44.940
Sir,

18:45.700 --> 18:46.460
have a taste.

18:46.980 --> 18:47.840
It's too sweet.

18:49.660 --> 18:50.880
Isn't zongzi supposed to be sweet?

18:50.880 --> 18:51.480
Let me try.

18:51.480 --> 18:54.410
I'm still used to the savory zongzi
from my hometown.

18:57.010 --> 18:57.940
It's delicious.

19:02.250 --> 19:03.250
When I was in Shanghai,

19:03.250 --> 19:05.660
I was craving the yogurt zongzi
from Kashgar.

19:05.660 --> 19:06.350
Xia Zi.

19:07.380 --> 19:08.840
Are you staying in Kashgar

19:09.500 --> 19:10.940
for good this time?

19:11.590 --> 19:14.310
You were my favorite student back then.

19:14.460 --> 19:16.290
Your reading notes

19:16.500 --> 19:17.700
were always the best.

19:18.490 --> 19:20.190
I remember in class,

19:20.220 --> 19:21.980
Arzugul was always the first,

19:22.250 --> 19:24.180
and Fang Nan was always the second.

19:24.270 --> 19:26.730
I gave Fang Nan quite
a lot of extra tutoring.

19:26.790 --> 19:28.850
But he just couldn't score higher
than Xia Zi.

19:28.850 --> 19:30.250
Isn't that frustrating?

19:30.510 --> 19:31.530
I even asked him,

19:31.530 --> 19:33.400
"Does Ms. Li tutor you at home?"

19:33.400 --> 19:34.680
He told me no.

19:34.680 --> 19:35.460
He's lied.

19:35.590 --> 19:36.500
Do you know?

19:36.960 --> 19:39.740
Back then, he liked a girl in your class.

19:40.200 --> 19:42.660
He secretly made an almond necklace
at home.

19:43.110 --> 19:45.200
Even now, I don't know who that girl was.

19:45.200 --> 19:45.460
It's ready.

19:45.460 --> 19:46.990
Xia Zi, do you know who it is?

19:47.330 --> 19:48.590
I don't know, either.

19:58.460 --> 19:59.860
If at that class reunion,

20:00.980 --> 20:02.240
I had been a bit braver,

20:03.250 --> 20:04.270
maybe our child

20:04.300 --> 20:06.560
would be old enough to run errands by now.

20:06.680 --> 20:08.280
I wanted to stay in Shanghai.

20:08.640 --> 20:11.570
Maybe we would've broken up
right after graduation.

20:12.920 --> 20:13.770
Or maybe

20:14.240 --> 20:15.250
we didn't.

20:16.740 --> 20:18.050
We would have

20:19.290 --> 20:20.460
a very happy family.

20:22.090 --> 20:22.850
Maybe

20:23.400 --> 20:24.860
we would never leave here.

20:27.310 --> 20:29.810
Then maybe we'd have gotten sick
of each other by now—

20:29.810 --> 20:30.850
me sick of you,

20:30.850 --> 20:31.700
you sick of me.

20:32.980 --> 20:34.380
Or… we could

20:34.740 --> 20:36.470
be happy even while bickering.

20:41.030 --> 20:41.700
Xia Zi.

20:48.090 --> 20:48.950
This is for you.

20:50.020 --> 20:51.880
I know you won't accept it easily.

20:52.010 --> 20:53.810
Just consider it my investment.

20:54.750 --> 20:56.280
I heard about Zhou Hengzhi.

20:57.960 --> 20:59.160
Do you really believe

20:59.900 --> 21:00.830
he'll come back?

21:03.550 --> 21:05.680
I know why you're giving me this money.

21:06.070 --> 21:07.600
So I really can't accept it.

21:08.290 --> 21:10.150
When you graduated from college,

21:10.570 --> 21:12.410
you had so many good opportunities,

21:12.410 --> 21:14.470
yet you still chose to come back here.

21:15.110 --> 21:17.510
That day when I saw you treating the lamb,

21:18.510 --> 21:19.050
I knew

21:19.990 --> 21:20.950
you belong here.

21:21.120 --> 21:22.650
You can't leave this place.

21:24.570 --> 21:25.970
But you're back now, too.

21:27.770 --> 21:29.810
But I'm not sure where I'll go next.

21:32.240 --> 21:34.160
Where my future lies,

21:34.510 --> 21:35.290
I don't know.

21:36.010 --> 21:37.900
So I definitely can't take this money.

21:37.900 --> 21:39.230
It's good for both of us.

21:42.680 --> 21:43.530
I understand.

21:46.570 --> 21:47.770
I won't push you.

21:53.180 --> 21:53.900
Xia Zi.

21:59.290 --> 22:00.140
This thing—

22:01.750 --> 22:03.080
I hope you can accept it.

22:08.030 --> 22:09.030
I wanted to give

22:11.000 --> 22:13.730
this almond necklace
to you at the class reunion.

22:14.480 --> 22:15.810
But I kept it for 7 years,

22:16.370 --> 22:17.370
and it got ruined.

22:17.880 --> 22:18.850
I fixed it again.

22:29.350 --> 22:30.350
Please accept it.

22:32.860 --> 22:33.920
Once you accept it,

22:35.970 --> 22:37.230
I can finally let it go.

22:48.880 --> 22:49.500
Okay,

22:50.270 --> 22:51.050
I'll take it.

22:52.790 --> 22:53.700
Now that I've accepted it,

22:53.700 --> 22:54.670
you can let it go.

23:09.380 --> 23:10.640
Does it look good on me?

23:12.000 --> 23:12.770
It does.

23:30.240 --> 23:31.530
Can't she put more effort into this?

23:31.530 --> 23:32.050
Yeah.

23:32.050 --> 23:33.330
The dress size was wrong.

23:33.330 --> 23:34.330
It was too tight.

23:34.980 --> 23:37.180
I couldn't even finish my move just now.

23:39.880 --> 23:41.740
Is Gulistan's outfit ready yet?

23:41.740 --> 23:43.380
I need to take it to her.

23:43.810 --> 23:46.140
Too slow.
You're slowing everything down.

23:46.140 --> 23:46.940
-I'm sorry.
-Minawar.

23:46.940 --> 23:47.680
Not this one.

23:47.750 --> 23:49.210
One headpiece is missing.

23:51.110 --> 23:52.570
Headpiece, headpiece...

23:53.010 --> 23:55.740
So it's true that you get mom brain
after having a baby.

23:55.740 --> 23:57.200
If you slept less than 5 hours a day,

23:57.200 --> 23:58.400
you'd be out of it, too.

23:58.400 --> 23:58.980
You...

24:16.230 --> 24:17.760
Stop working. Come with me.

24:19.160 --> 24:20.460
Let's go.

24:21.060 --> 24:21.710
What?

24:21.740 --> 24:22.570
To eat.

24:24.980 --> 24:26.700
I can't leave now.

24:52.720 --> 24:53.750
Do you want a toy?

24:54.190 --> 24:55.180
Do you want a toy?

24:55.200 --> 24:56.200
I'll get you a toy.

24:58.960 --> 24:59.770
What is this?

25:03.510 --> 25:04.460
Diet pills?

25:04.660 --> 25:06.420
Your hair is falling out in handfuls.

25:06.420 --> 25:08.080
You can't take these anymore.

25:08.850 --> 25:10.050
I know you want to keep in shape,

25:10.050 --> 25:11.770
but you shouldn't take this.

25:12.590 --> 25:13.520
Starting today,

25:14.330 --> 25:15.570
we will supervise you.

25:15.570 --> 25:16.400
We'll accompany her

25:16.400 --> 25:17.420
to run and take care of the baby.

25:17.420 --> 25:18.090
Okay.

25:18.750 --> 25:19.650
Let's go.

25:20.340 --> 25:21.400
Let her sleep a bit.

25:27.030 --> 25:27.720
Come on.

25:31.810 --> 25:32.550
Hurry up.

25:33.550 --> 25:34.400
Coming.

25:37.010 --> 25:38.410
It's scorching out here.

25:39.400 --> 25:40.260
You run so fast.

25:41.530 --> 25:42.220
Hurry up.

25:56.810 --> 25:57.530
I can't go on.

25:57.530 --> 25:58.850
You can do it.

26:12.290 --> 26:13.370
Have you thought about it?

26:13.370 --> 26:14.660
If you don't want to get married,

26:14.660 --> 26:15.550
we can help you.

26:18.380 --> 26:19.030
Come here.

26:19.500 --> 26:21.240
Look at my new quilt.

26:21.330 --> 26:22.140
Isn't it nice?

26:22.850 --> 26:24.180
It's very comfortable.

26:25.530 --> 26:26.400
Feel it.

26:27.110 --> 26:28.570
It's comfortable, right?

26:36.090 --> 26:37.140
Come on, come on. Have some pilaf, kids.

26:37.140 --> 26:38.660
Eat pilaf.

26:43.050 --> 26:44.770
Who made the pilaf?

26:44.770 --> 26:46.250
Her mom made it.

26:46.250 --> 26:47.310
It's so delicious.

26:47.980 --> 26:48.770
Eat pilaf, kids.

26:48.770 --> 26:50.460
You look so pretty today.

26:52.830 --> 26:55.250
Her cooking just keeps getting better.

26:56.410 --> 26:57.150
Laili.

26:57.700 --> 26:58.420
Laili.

26:59.850 --> 27:00.780
Mulading, he...

27:04.960 --> 27:06.660
Master, Ma'am,

27:07.100 --> 27:08.150
Laili,

27:08.660 --> 27:09.580
I'm leaving.

27:14.180 --> 27:15.030
Grandma.

27:15.590 --> 27:17.190
Go on, read it, child.

27:21.420 --> 27:22.460
For so many years,

27:22.480 --> 27:23.810
thank you for your care.

27:24.790 --> 27:26.090
I'm an orphan,

27:26.390 --> 27:28.450
and you gave me the warmth of a family.

27:28.630 --> 27:29.630
But in the end,

27:30.440 --> 27:32.110
this is not my home.

27:35.680 --> 27:37.870
Rather than a home given to me by others,

27:37.870 --> 27:39.730
I want my own home more.

27:40.550 --> 27:43.180
I took the 30,000 yuan betrothal gift.

27:43.930 --> 27:46.100
Master, Ma'am, don't blame me.

27:47.100 --> 27:49.980
Just take it as compensation
for the slap Master gave me,

27:49.980 --> 27:52.810
and Laili's ignoring me.

27:52.930 --> 27:54.720
I won't feel sorry for you,

27:54.770 --> 27:56.290
because I truly considered you

27:56.290 --> 27:57.770
my family.

27:58.310 --> 28:00.710
You don't need to feel sorry
for me, either,

28:00.830 --> 28:03.230
because I've always been just an outsider.

28:05.170 --> 28:07.300
You've already done more than enough.

28:09.440 --> 28:10.240
Dad.

28:13.350 --> 28:14.070
Mom.

28:14.970 --> 28:15.770
Grandma.

28:25.750 --> 28:26.900
Let's eat first.

28:27.140 --> 28:29.610
Auntie made such a huge spread.

28:29.830 --> 28:30.550
Eat up.

28:31.300 --> 28:32.100
Try this naan.

28:32.720 --> 28:33.790
-Let's eat.
-Auntie made them this morning.

28:33.790 --> 28:34.640
Let's eat.

28:34.640 --> 28:36.170
They're really delicious.

28:36.350 --> 28:36.880
Really.

28:37.480 --> 28:37.960
Try it.

28:38.110 --> 28:38.750
Mom,

28:39.480 --> 28:41.570
Dad bought this this morning.

28:43.900 --> 28:44.550
Eat more.

28:44.810 --> 28:45.500
Eat more.

28:53.720 --> 28:54.650
It's delicious.

29:09.980 --> 29:11.220
Come on. Let's have a toast.

29:11.220 --> 29:12.400
To what?

29:12.880 --> 29:14.190
To

29:14.270 --> 29:16.600
the costumes I'll never get to wear again.

29:17.000 --> 29:18.160
Baby.

29:18.720 --> 29:19.510
Then...

29:20.140 --> 29:21.000
to the dutar

29:21.660 --> 29:23.530
that I can never play again.

29:23.920 --> 29:25.320
What about you, Arzugul?

29:26.480 --> 29:27.420
Me?

29:29.140 --> 29:31.030
Then I'll toast to

29:32.140 --> 29:33.580
the Shanghai

29:33.610 --> 29:35.750
that I might never return to.

29:36.250 --> 29:37.070
Cheers.

29:40.250 --> 29:41.250
Who among you

29:41.330 --> 29:43.650
can actually marry a husband
into the family?

29:43.650 --> 29:44.740
Only me.

29:44.770 --> 29:46.370
Only I, Laili, could do that.

29:47.240 --> 29:48.070
Only you.

29:48.680 --> 29:49.330
Drink less.

29:49.330 --> 29:51.590
Impressive. I admit you are impressive.

29:51.900 --> 29:53.200
You're indeed impressive.

29:53.200 --> 29:55.400
Your groom even ran away at the wedding.

29:56.310 --> 29:58.900
I've only ever heard of runaway brides,

29:58.900 --> 30:01.750
but never a runaway groom.

30:01.750 --> 30:04.680
Indeed, not many women
have this kind of experience.

30:04.720 --> 30:05.290
Right.

30:05.290 --> 30:07.220
It's so hard.

30:09.070 --> 30:09.880
Yeah.

30:18.610 --> 30:20.900
Actually, you are better off than we are.

30:22.650 --> 30:26.090
Because she has 2 good besties
who are more miserable than her,

30:26.090 --> 30:27.030
right?

30:27.350 --> 30:28.590
Am I miserable?

30:28.630 --> 30:30.090
Am I very miserable?

30:30.850 --> 30:31.910
Am I?

30:31.940 --> 30:32.550
You are not.

30:32.550 --> 30:33.180
I am.

30:33.180 --> 30:34.310
You are not, either.

30:34.850 --> 30:36.140
I am. I am, okay?

30:36.140 --> 30:37.000
I am miserable.

30:37.190 --> 30:39.200
I don't want either of you
to have it worse than me.

30:39.200 --> 30:40.090
As for me,

30:40.090 --> 30:40.830
I want you

30:41.480 --> 30:43.240
to become the absolute

30:43.240 --> 30:44.680
best dancer.

30:45.380 --> 30:46.280
I want you

30:46.620 --> 30:49.660
to become the most skilled
earthenware craftswoman.

30:52.140 --> 30:53.720
None of us should be miserable.

30:53.720 --> 30:56.550
Why should we have it bad at all?

31:17.880 --> 31:18.880
Already watered?

31:46.960 --> 31:47.650
Hello.

31:48.710 --> 31:49.520
My friend.

31:54.880 --> 31:56.540
Got your knucklebones on you?

32:00.160 --> 32:01.220
I have them with me.

32:10.460 --> 32:11.590
I said I'd come back,

32:13.010 --> 32:14.270
and I definitely will.

32:26.420 --> 32:29.330
Zhou Hengzhi is back.

32:29.570 --> 32:30.500
Zhou Hengzhi,

32:30.500 --> 32:31.570
you're finally back.

32:31.570 --> 32:33.960
I thought you lied to Xia Zi

32:33.960 --> 32:35.400
and would never return.

32:36.250 --> 32:37.330
Who told you that nonsense?

32:37.330 --> 32:38.180
You little brat.

32:38.180 --> 32:39.810
Was it Rejep or Abudu?

32:39.810 --> 32:42.070
Neither.

32:42.070 --> 32:43.980
My friend Shirzat told me.

32:46.140 --> 32:48.010
And who is Shirzat?

32:49.530 --> 32:51.000
How do you guys know everything?

32:51.000 --> 32:53.090
You adults are so silly.

32:53.090 --> 32:55.660
You only hear what you want to hear,

32:55.660 --> 32:56.980
but always forget the people and things

32:56.980 --> 32:59.330
closest to you.

33:00.610 --> 33:02.740
You've got an answer for everything.

33:03.420 --> 33:06.680
Little rubber ball, banana, and pear.

33:06.680 --> 33:09.750
Maran blossoms—21,

33:09.750 --> 33:11.330
25, 26,

33:11.330 --> 33:13.050
25, 27,

33:13.050 --> 33:15.740
28, 29, 31.

33:17.640 --> 33:18.610
Why are we clapping?

33:18.610 --> 33:19.340
I don't know.

33:21.830 --> 33:23.200
What's this?

33:27.140 --> 33:27.940
Where is this?

33:28.290 --> 33:29.020
My hometown.

33:29.550 --> 33:30.660
Have you been to Xichang?

33:30.660 --> 33:31.420
Never.

33:31.850 --> 33:32.980
It's a plateau, too,

33:33.070 --> 33:34.670
but not as high as the Pamirs.

33:34.740 --> 33:35.810
Are these your parents?

33:35.810 --> 33:36.700
How did you know?

33:36.700 --> 33:37.900
They look a bit like you.

33:37.900 --> 33:38.900
Those two are really in love—

33:38.900 --> 33:40.140
the kind who sing

33:40.140 --> 33:42.000
while doing housework together.

33:42.140 --> 33:42.860
I envy you.

33:44.050 --> 33:45.510
This is my first homestay.

33:45.510 --> 33:47.640
It's in Qingcheng Mountain, Chengdu.

33:48.310 --> 33:49.710
You take such great photos.

33:49.710 --> 33:51.660
Take more when our homestay opens.

33:53.090 --> 33:55.010
This is probably
my swan song in photography.

33:55.010 --> 33:56.580
Where do you think the money came from?

33:56.580 --> 33:57.340
I sold

33:57.360 --> 33:59.160
my camera and all my lenses.

34:00.290 --> 34:00.980
Good thing

34:01.400 --> 34:03.860
I bought limited-edition lenses back then.

34:04.000 --> 34:05.260
That must've cost you.

34:07.310 --> 34:08.230
I can tell

34:08.960 --> 34:11.159
you are already attached to this place.

34:24.130 --> 34:25.659
I just snapped it casually.

34:26.360 --> 34:27.489
You took quite a few.

34:34.000 --> 34:35.510
I don't think

34:36.050 --> 34:36.980
any of these are as good as this one.

34:36.980 --> 34:37.639
Look,

34:37.780 --> 34:38.780
how natural it is.

34:39.010 --> 34:40.610
I think this one is nice, too.

34:40.900 --> 34:41.460
Don't delete it.

34:41.460 --> 34:42.659
I already deleted it.

34:42.690 --> 34:43.510
Do you know

34:43.510 --> 34:46.510
there's a feature called
recently deleted recovery?

34:46.670 --> 34:48.840
If you want to recover it, just do it.

34:53.010 --> 34:54.270
When did you take this?

34:57.630 --> 34:59.530
How could I let you know?

35:03.360 --> 35:04.020
Here you go.

35:04.460 --> 35:05.190
Send it to me.

35:06.530 --> 35:07.660
I charge for photos.

35:09.340 --> 35:12.200
I'll transfer the money.
Let's see if you accept it.

35:29.940 --> 35:31.940
Why are you wearing couple outfits?

35:31.980 --> 35:34.210
What couple outfits?

35:34.840 --> 35:35.650
But couple outfits

35:35.650 --> 35:38.450
shouldn't be identical
from head to toe like this.

35:39.330 --> 35:40.660
We think

35:40.680 --> 35:44.740
just cutting costs without generating
new income isn't a real solution.

35:44.780 --> 35:46.510
So, we got tour guide licenses.

35:46.820 --> 35:48.950
Pamir Sunny Days

35:48.970 --> 35:50.500
Private Custom Tours.

35:50.500 --> 35:51.630
What does this mean?

35:51.800 --> 35:53.050
This is a custom small-group tour

35:53.050 --> 35:54.450
we run in partnership
with a travel agency.

35:54.350 --> 35:55.380
[Kashgar Bus Terminal]

35:55.570 --> 35:56.770
Our car is right here.

35:58.920 --> 35:59.730
Here are the hats.

35:59.730 --> 36:00.860
Give me the luggage.

36:01.500 --> 36:02.130
Yours.

36:02.590 --> 36:03.550
The kid's.

36:06.360 --> 36:07.180
[Yummy Restaurant]

36:07.260 --> 36:08.570
Here's your lamb spine meat.

36:08.570 --> 36:09.340
Ready?

36:09.340 --> 36:09.730
Yes.

36:11.110 --> 36:13.500
Here are your lamb skewers.

36:13.980 --> 36:15.050
Your yogurt.

36:15.360 --> 36:16.010
One pilaf?

36:16.010 --> 36:16.500
Okay.

36:16.820 --> 36:17.210
Here.

36:20.080 --> 36:21.060
If you think it's good,

36:21.060 --> 36:22.800
please give us a five-star review.

36:22.800 --> 36:23.610
These earthenwares

36:23.610 --> 36:24.900
are definitely not products made

36:24.900 --> 36:26.430
on a factory assembly line.

36:27.010 --> 36:29.130
3, 2, 1.

36:30.940 --> 36:32.380
We're here to attend a local wedding?

36:32.380 --> 36:33.520
We have to dance?

36:34.420 --> 36:35.860
Don't be shy, everyone.

36:35.860 --> 36:36.840
Dance.

36:38.770 --> 36:40.250
Dance and sing.

36:45.630 --> 36:47.380
You're amazing, sir.

36:47.480 --> 36:48.820
The altitude is over 4,000 meters,

36:48.820 --> 36:50.300
and you don't have altitude sickness.

36:50.300 --> 36:51.230
Look, everyone.

36:51.280 --> 36:52.780
The road we're driving on now

36:52.780 --> 36:54.110
has more than 600 bends.

36:54.730 --> 36:55.360
They say,

36:55.460 --> 36:57.420
if you walk
all the twists and turns today,

36:57.420 --> 36:58.420
your life from now on

36:58.420 --> 36:59.620
will be a smooth path.

37:08.920 --> 37:09.590
Sir, ma'am.

37:09.800 --> 37:11.860
Why don't you sit there and rest a bit?

37:11.960 --> 37:12.300
It's fine.

37:12.300 --> 37:14.030
Don't just keep standing here.

37:15.590 --> 37:16.730
I have water here.

37:17.010 --> 37:17.780
Ma'am,

37:18.000 --> 37:18.690
here's some water.

37:18.690 --> 37:19.570
Okay, thanks.

37:19.600 --> 37:20.190
Sir,

37:21.420 --> 37:22.010
yours.

37:22.530 --> 37:23.860
It'scorching out here.

37:24.050 --> 37:25.280
Pour some water to cool down.

37:25.280 --> 37:26.000
-Ma'am.
-I can't stand it anymore.

37:26.000 --> 37:26.500
Here.

37:29.610 --> 37:30.980
How about we walk towards the road

37:30.980 --> 37:32.150
and go meet Zhou Hengzhi?

37:32.150 --> 37:33.150
I think he'll be here soon.

37:33.150 --> 37:33.820
Okay.

37:34.460 --> 37:34.940
Come on.

37:42.400 --> 37:43.210
Over here.

37:47.500 --> 37:48.820
Get in. Get in.

37:48.820 --> 37:49.490
Thanks for waiting.

37:49.490 --> 37:50.290
Sorry.

37:51.650 --> 37:52.460
I'm a bit late.

37:52.460 --> 37:55.920
I just dropped off the guests
from the last tour at the airport.

38:01.110 --> 38:02.750
[Welcome to Kashgar Hotel]

38:03.380 --> 38:04.090
Xia. Xia.

38:04.090 --> 38:04.650
Ma'am.

38:04.650 --> 38:05.800
I just realized my camera

38:05.800 --> 38:07.880
was left at that photo spot in the desert.

38:07.880 --> 38:09.510
My camera is very expensive.

38:09.780 --> 38:11.310
My photos are in there, too.

38:11.920 --> 38:12.860
Ma'am, look.

38:13.010 --> 38:13.820
Calm down.

38:13.860 --> 38:15.120
I'll go look for it now.

38:15.260 --> 38:17.090
Please help promote our agency later.

38:17.090 --> 38:18.160
Sure.

38:18.280 --> 38:18.880
Thank you.

38:18.910 --> 38:21.370
It's fine.
We'll let you know when we find it.

38:23.500 --> 38:24.320
Zhou Hengzhi!

38:42.910 --> 38:43.580
Hello.

38:44.150 --> 38:47.010
The number you dial is not available.

38:47.480 --> 38:48.880
Please dail again later.

39:42.670 --> 39:43.400
Are you okay?

39:43.760 --> 39:45.960
Why did you come here?
Do you have a death wish?

39:45.960 --> 39:48.160
I was afraid you'd be buried by the sand.

39:51.000 --> 39:52.600
The sandstorm is too strong.

39:52.970 --> 39:54.900
I don't think we can leave tonight.

39:57.210 --> 39:58.860
You knew there was a sandstorm,

39:58.860 --> 40:00.190
yet you still came here.

40:00.760 --> 40:02.400
I was worried sick.

40:24.900 --> 40:27.830
Have you heard of the sands
of quantum entanglement?

40:29.710 --> 40:31.820
Two grains of sand split
from the same rock—

40:31.820 --> 40:33.530
even if they are worlds apart，

40:35.130 --> 40:36.420
when one is touched,

40:36.650 --> 40:39.580
the other will resonate
at the exact same frequency.

40:41.980 --> 40:44.510
People parting ways
each hold a grain of sand.

40:44.570 --> 40:46.210
When one misses the other,

40:46.550 --> 40:49.010
the other's grain
will tremble in response.

40:53.360 --> 40:55.220
You just made that up, didn't you?

40:56.710 --> 40:57.950
Not entirely.

40:58.560 --> 41:00.980
Part of it actually
has a scientific basis.

41:10.210 --> 41:12.070
When we wake up tomorrow morning,

41:12.920 --> 41:15.090
we'll not be buried in the sand, right?

41:26.650 --> 41:27.590
I'm sorry.

41:28.000 --> 41:29.330
I dragged you into this.

41:37.590 --> 41:38.400
What's wrong?

41:38.990 --> 41:40.920
Why are you looking at me like that?

41:41.090 --> 41:42.370
Is... Is there something

41:42.370 --> 41:43.160
on my face?

41:45.730 --> 41:47.930
You're still joking at a time like this?

41:48.010 --> 41:49.470
You're really something.

41:56.210 --> 41:57.810
I was really scared just now.

41:58.920 --> 42:00.720
I was afraid you'd be like my dad,

42:00.830 --> 42:01.890
never coming back.

42:16.070 --> 42:17.090
Xia Zi

42:22.060 --> 42:22.850
I...

42:27.610 --> 42:29.640
I don't want us to just be friends.
